RESULT.CBA.NOTES
Since the refreshcount gets incremented previously
so IoHwAb_PwmStatus.RefreshCount = 1.
if(IoHwAb_PwmStatus.RefreshCount >= IOHWAB_NUM_OF_PWM_OUTPUT)
this statement will always be true. 

It was based on the configuration input.
IOHWAB_NUM_OF_PWM_OUTPUT = 1u
RESULT.CBA.NOTES_END
